+ * restart-separated buffer is unrolled into an independent-primitive list before
+ * it is drawn, on the CPU at pipeline-compile time for POLY_GS_SHAPE_STATIC_
+ * INDEXED (gsi->topology is a compile-time constant) and on the GPU at draw time
+ * for POLY_GS_SHAPE_DYNAMIC_INDEXED (libkk_unroll_geometry, the same kernel that
+ * unrolls an application index buffer with restart). See kk_launch_gs().
